# dd on a Starred entry deletes the block from the outline, and z brings it back with its children.
file <<END
Trip:
	- Book flights @star
		- Compare prices
	- Pack bags @star
END
keys gS dd
hide Book flights
see - Pack bags
keys z
see - Book flights
quit
saved <<END
Trip:
	- Book flights @star
		- Compare prices
	- Pack bags @star
END
